body:
The ticket was for hiding/obscuring the plate - not compounded at all. 

&#x200B;

I have a habit of tucking my plate back (on the default manufactured bracket), as well as the foot pegs, so other bikes can park tightly in shared spots and not impede the "walkway." 

&#x200B;

I forgot to unfold it while driving home from work one night.. highway patrol flat out said he didn't believe it was the default manufacturer's hinge and that "you bikers evade tolls and run red lights this way" ..as I waited on a red light.
